--- /dev/null
+++ b/CHANGES_202.79.txt
@@ -0,0 +1,7 @@
+TVStreammerSAT5 202.79
+
+- HLS audio stability: preserve mpegtsmux PCR/PTS after mux instead of re-timestamping the TS with tsparse; 12 s output queue; audiorate 20 ms jitter correction at 48 kHz.
+- Intel H.264 hardware encoding: qsvh264enc preferred, then vah264enc, then legacy vaapih264enc; Auto order NVENC -> Intel -> x264.
+- HLS DVR archive with per-stream enable, retention 1..168 hours and storage path.
+- Flussonic-compatible HLS archive URL forms: archive-FROM-DURATION.m3u8, rewind-AGO.m3u8, timeshift_rel-AGO.m3u8, timeshift_abs-FROM.m3u8.
+- Archive segments survive stream restarts via generation-unique filenames and are pruned by retention.
